===============================================================================

catatui is a port of ratatui, and its layout solver is a port of kasuari. Both
are used under the MIT license, which requires their copyright notices to
travel with the work. Those notices follow.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ratatui (https://github.com/ratatui/ratatui)

Nearly every file in this repository is derived from ratatui, and each names the
Rust source it was ported from in a header comment. Some of it is copied rather
than translated: the world map coordinates in widgets/canvas_world.go, the colour
values under palette/, and the border-merging fixtures in widgets/testdata/block,
which are ratatui's own test output.

