-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
kasuari (https://github.com/ratatui/kasuari)

internal/kasuari is a port of the kasuari crate, the Cassowary constraint solver
that ratatui's Layout is built on. kasuari is offered under MIT OR Apache-2.0;
it is used here under MIT.

